<title>KIRIBATI: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>KIRIBATI GOVERNMENT LIST (970603)</p>
<p> President (Apptd 1 Oct 1994)....................Teburoro TITO</p>
<p>(Also Minister of Foreign Affairs)</p>
<p> Vice-president................................Tewareka TENTOA</p>
<p>(Also Minister of Home Affairs &amp; Rural Development)</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MANEABAN TE MAURI PARTY GOVERNMENT (Formed 4 Oct 1994)</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Commerce, Industry &amp; Tourism.....................Tiim TAEKITI</p>
<p> Education, Training &amp; Technology..............Teiraoi TETABEA</p>
<p> Environment &amp; Social Development..............Tewareka BOORAU</p>
<p> Finance &amp; Economic Planning...................Beniamina TINGA</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs.................................See president</p>
<p> Health &amp; Family Planning......................Kataotika TEKEE</p>
<p> Home Affairs &amp; Rural Development...........See vice-president</p>
<p> Information, Communication &amp; Transport..........Manraoi KAIEA</p>
<p> Labour, Employment &amp; Cooperatives.............Tanieru AWERIKA</p>
<p> Line &amp; Phoenix Development......................Timbo KEARIKI</p>
